{"articleNo":"572970","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=572970&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 2026년 KOTRA 체험형 인턴(장애인 전형) 채용 안내","writer":"학생과","writeDate":"2026.08.07","hit":"7325","attachments":[{"name":"1. 2026년 하반기 KOTRA 체험형 청년인턴(장애인) 수시모집 공고 및 직무기술서.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=572970&attachNo=166989"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: 0px; margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -17.1pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">대한무역투자진흥공사(KOTRA)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">는 청년들의 글로벌 역량 강화 및 직무경험 제공을 위하여</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -17.1pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"text-indent: -17.1pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">체험형 청년인턴제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -17.1pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">’</span><span style=\"text-indent: -17.1pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">를 운영해오고 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -17.1pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">년 하반기 체험형 청년인턴</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">장애인 전형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">채용 공고를 다음과 같이 안내드리니 관심 있는 학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">ㅇ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">년 하반기 체험형 청년인턴</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">장애인 전형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">모집</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">모집 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">:‘26</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">일 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">~‘26</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">31</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">일 까지 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">개월 간</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">    </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">* 12/15 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">이내 인터넷 접수 요망 </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">원서접수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">인터넷 접수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(http://kotra.applyin.co.kr) </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">ㅇ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">참고사항 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">매월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">일에 근로계약 체결 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">자세한 사항은 공고문 참고 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.)</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">              </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">최종합격 후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">부서 협의 하에 유연근무</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">재택근무 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림체;mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:13.0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height:150%;margin-top:2.0pt;margin-bottom:2.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">붙임 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">: 1. 2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">년 하반기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">kotra </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">체험형 인턴</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">장애인 전형</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">수시모집 공고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">안</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">)  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 13pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:굴림체;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"18092\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2026-08-07T09:50:16.302Z\",\n\"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\